  COA_MissionDescriptor "{6A97166B808044BC}" {
   m_sTitle "Mission: Situation"
   m_sTextData "The operation has completely failed. HQ has sent us one last radio transmission that we need to attempt to extract as many supplies as possible from our regimental HQ, and then pull out."\
   ""\
   "Of course, they failed to mention that the entirety of two divisions are barreling down upon us from the West as of this morning. We're going to reattack the front line and attempt to hold out as long as possible."
